body:
I could publish it with this setting and the diff. But we have to consider making the workflow to publish.

https://jsr.io/@hono/do-not-use-this 

```json
{
  "name": "@hono/do-not-use-this",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "lib": [
      "dom",
      "dom.iterable",
      "deno.ns"
    ],
    "jsx": "react",
    "jsxFactory": "jsx"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./deno_dist/mod.ts"
  },
  "publish": {
    "include": [
      "deno.json",
      "LICENSE",
      "README.md",
      "deno_dist/**/*.ts"
    ],
    "exclude": [
      "deno_dist/**/*.test.ts",
      "deno_dist/**/*.test.tsx"
    ]
  }
}
```

